{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/Tagline.v2.png?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 2024 true-crime podcast &quot;My Escape from the Slackjaw Killer&quot; took America by storm\u2014with its unflinching interview of his only known surviving victim. Painstakingly recreated from testimony, crime scene photos, and FBI reports, this game puts you in Slackjaw's world and asks: Will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Average playtime: 1 hour</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/SteamSubTitles_Explore.png?t=1750112285\" /></div>Explore the world of a serial killer as his next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/Gif_Explore.gif?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/SteamSubTitles_Solve.png?t=1750112285\" /></div>Use your wits and resources to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/Gif_Examine.gif?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/SteamSubTitles_Uncover.png?t=1750112285\" /></div>Uncover the twisted secrets buried deep within his basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/Gif_Tunnel.gif?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/SteamSubTitles_Escape.png?t=1750112285\" /></div>Escape to survive. But be quiet, he's upstairs....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/Gif_Code.gif?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/extras/SteamSubTitles_Features.png?t=1750112285\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape room gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hyper-realistic graphics powered by Unreal Engine 5 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haunting original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xbox controller support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete in a single play session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   Created by a solo developer</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3073900?t=1750112285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3073900?t=1750112285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/eab134feb099d9bd8cfacf356757554c42532b71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750112285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073900/eab134feb099d9